## Original Content
Министр образования региона Наталия Бастрикова посоветовала провести мероприятия в помещениях с минимальным количеством участников

## Summary
The Minister of Education in Kirov Oblast, Natalia Bastrikova, has advised schools to avoid holding outdoor lines on September 1st and instead conduct events indoors with minimal participants. This recommendation aims to adjust traditional celebrations for safety or health reasons.

## Key Points
- Schools in Kirov Oblast are recommended to not hold outdoor lines on September 1st.
- Events should be conducted indoors to minimize the number of participants.
- The advice comes from the regional Minister of Education, Natalia Bastrikova.
- This is a measure related to traditional September 1st school celebrations.


